  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your research into this strange branch of magic yields additional information when identifying what is being cast.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Spellcraft 5 ranks</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you successfully identify an etherspell being cast, you learn the names of all of the manifestations in the etherspell in addition to the type of etherheart being cast. You receive a +2 luck bonus to saving throws against etherspells you have identified in this manner.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Whenever you successfully identify an etherspell being cast, you learn its etherheart.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
